WEBVTT

00:06:27.669 --> 00:06:30.288
Some of them are quite obvious.

00:06:30.572 --> 00:06:31.573
(Breathing)

00:06:32.223 --> 00:06:34.809
Things like ...

00:06:34.809 --> 00:06:36.528
cotton buds ...

00:06:36.528 --> 00:06:38.880
and ...

00:06:38.880 --> 00:06:40.231
cotton pads.

00:06:41.366 --> 00:06:45.103
(Video) Paris ASMR: I’ve brought
some tasty tea from Paris.

00:06:46.755 --> 00:06:48.273
For you, yeah.

00:06:50.208 --> 00:06:55.397
It is called, “Weekend à Paris.”

00:06:56.915 --> 00:06:59.017
“Weekend in Paris.”